[C1] PASS r -> (p, l) -> r is the identity: b = 1..16, 1-24 processes: 4896 ranks, 0 mismatches
[C2] PASS (p, l) -> r maps the P b pairs onto 0..P b - 1, with no gap or repeat: 4896 pairs, 0 layouts not a bijection
